    "text": "By Jared Goffinet ,\n12 hours ago DRY RIDGE, Ky. (WXIX) - Two people are dead following a head-on crash in Northern Kentucky, according to Kentucky State Police. The two-vehicle crash happened on Taft Highway in Dry Ridge, the Grant County Sheriff’s Office posted on Facebook. The sheriff’s office said the highway is closed as of... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 5",
